===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|dos}}, variant of {{m|enm|doth}}, {{m|enm|doþ}}, equivalent to {{af|en|do|-s}}. For the shortened vowel compare {{m|en|says}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/dəz/|q=weak form}}
* {{IPA|en|/dʌz/|q=strong form}}, {{enPR|dŭz}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-does-todo.ogg|a=US}}
* {{IPA|en|/dʊz/|a=Northern England,Dublin}}
* {{rhymes|en|ʌz|s=1}}

